    "text": "morgantownmag.com\nwebsite\nMorgantown\nHaus of Fashions Opens in Morgantown\n12 hours ago\nIt’s the newest place to go for your streetwear needs. Look no further than 320 High Street to elevate your street style! Haus of Fashions, owned by husband-and-wife duo Simenon Rogers and Sierra White, offers high-end urban fashion unlike anything else in the area. “There were no clothing stores here or in the mall for streetwear,” Rogers says.\n2",
